{"seq":1,"slug":"scoping-agent-work-to-packages","title":"把 Agent 的工作圈定到包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/scoping-agent-work-to-packages","wordCount":1874,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"把-agent-的工作圈定到包\">把 Agent 的工作圈定到包</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>圈定范围是把 monorepo 问题还原成单包问题：按包边界定义工作集，把边界写进命令，把包级知识放进包里。三个概念贯穿全篇：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>圈定</td>\n<td>用包边界把 agent 的读写集合收窄到少数几个包</td>\n<td>控制上下文成本与改动半径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>写集 / 验集</td>\n<td>改动集合从窄，验证集合必须沿依赖图放大</td>\n<td>全篇的操作纲领</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就近指令</td>\n<td>包级 AGENTS.md，离被编辑文件最近者优先</td>\n<td>把包级知识放在包里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可执行边界</td>\n<td>包边界由 workspace glob 定义，用 <code>--filter</code> 表达</td>\n<td>让圈定从口头嘱咐变成可执行的选择器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>圈定的理由是成本：全局装载要付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{N} C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的上下文代价，圈定后只需根说明、目标包与一层依赖接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么圈进一个包有效\">为什么圈进一个包有效</h2><p>Agent 在 monorepo 里的表现上限,几乎完全由它拿到的上下文质量决定。在一个有几十个包的仓库里,「先看懂整个仓库再动手」是伪策略:绝大多数任务的读写集合天然落在少数几个包内,全局视野带来的主要是噪音。圈定范围之所以有效,可以用一笔账说清——设仓库有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个包、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个包的完整上下文量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>,则全局装载与圈定后的上下文成本分别为:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>scoped</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>root</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>d</mi><mtext>iface</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{global}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} C_i, \\qquad C_{\\text{scoped}} = C_{\\text{root}} + C_{p} + \\sum_{d \\in D(p)} C^{\\text{iface}}_{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">global</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scoped</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">root</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">iface</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标包,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是它的直接依赖集合,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mtext>iface</mtext></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^{\\text{iface}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">iface</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是依赖包的接口层文档(导出的类型与函数签名),远小于包全文。以本仓库为例,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span>(<code>web/packages/</code> 下的共享包数量);若每包平均 2–3 KB 说明与接口文档,全局装载约 30–40 KB,而圈定后通常不足 10 KB——省下的窗口预算全部让给了目标包的真实源码。圈定同时收窄<strong>改动半径</strong>:写入集中在一个包内,review 与回滚的粒度随之变小。圈定所依据的包边界从哪来,见<a href=\"../monorepo-and-agents/package-boundaries-as-the-map\">包边界作为 Agent 的地图</a>。</p>\n<p>权衡在于圈多窄:太窄会漏掉依赖方的接口假设,太宽则退回噪音。经验值是「目标包 + 直接依赖的接口层 + 点名的下游」,对应上式第三项只取一层;更远的传递依赖交给验证阶段处理,而不是预装进上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"先定义包边界-再把范围写进命令\">先定义包边界,再把范围写进命令</h2><p>圈定的前提是「包」这个边界清晰可枚举。pnpm 用工作区根的 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code>(glob 列表)定义哪些目录是包,没有这个文件就不存在 workspace(<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/workspaces\">pnpm.io/workspaces</a>)。本仓库的定义可以直接参照:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# web/pnpm-workspace.yaml(本仓库现状)&#10;packages:&#10;  - &#39;packages/*&#39;&#10;  - &#39;apps/*/client&#39;&#10;  - &#39;apps/*/server&#39;&#10;  - &#39;apps/static-book&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># web/pnpm-workspace.yaml(本仓库现状)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'packages/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*/client'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/*/server'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'apps/static-book'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>有了边界,范围就从「口头嘱咐」变成「可执行的选择器」。pnpm 的 <code>--filter</code> 语法是写给 agent 的任务描述里最值得附上的一张表(<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/filtering\">pnpm.io/filtering</a>):</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选择器</th>\n<th>选中谁</th>\n<th>给 agent 的典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>--filter @l-doc-hub/markdown</code></td>\n<td>精确一个包</td>\n<td>单包测试/构建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter &quot;@l-doc-hub/*&quot;</code></td>\n<td>名字模式匹配的一组包</td>\n<td>整类包批量操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter foo...</code></td>\n<td>foo 及其全部依赖</td>\n<td>改了底层后连带验证上游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter &quot;foo^...&quot;</code></td>\n<td>仅 foo 的依赖</td>\n<td>只验证依赖链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter &quot;...foo&quot;</code></td>\n<td>foo 及其全部依赖方</td>\n<td>波及面初判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter &quot;...^foo&quot;</code></td>\n<td>仅 foo 的依赖方</td>\n<td>改共享包后跑下游测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--filter &quot;{packages/**}[origin/main]&quot;</code></td>\n<td>目录内相对基线有变更的包</td>\n<td>只碰动过的包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--fail-if-no-match</code></td>\n<td>过滤器零匹配时报错退出</td>\n<td>防止拼错包名静默空跑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行尤其适合交给 agent:过滤器写错时,宁可显式失败也不要「成功地什么都没做」。AGENTS.md 官方示例同样以 filter 为词表——<code>pnpm install --filter &lt;project_name&gt;</code>、<code>pnpm turbo run test --filter &lt;project_name&gt;</code>(<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a>);「按包过滤」已经是跨工具的 agent 通用语,任务里写清楚目标包名,等于同时给了它命令与边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"就近指令文件-嵌套-agents-md\">就近指令文件:嵌套 AGENTS.md</h2><p>圈定的另一半,是把「这个包怎么干活」写进包里。AGENTS.md 格式规范明确支持嵌套:在每个包内再放一份,agent 自动读取离被编辑文件最近的那个,最近者优先;用户在对话中的显式指示则压过一切文件(<a href=\"https://agents.md/\">agents.md</a> FAQ)。规范页面提到,撰写时 OpenAI 主仓库里有 88 份 AGENTS.md——嵌套不是理论建议,而是大型仓库的实际形态。该格式源自 OpenAI Codex、Amp、Google Jules、Cursor、Factory 的协作,现由 Linux 基金会旗下 Agentic AI Foundation 托管,站点自称已被超过 6 万个开源项目采用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    T[&quot;任务:修复 markdown 渲染缺陷&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;任务文本写明目标包&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; W[&quot;读根 AGENTS.md&lt;br/&gt;全局布局 + 工具链 + 依赖禁区&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; P[&quot;读 packages/markdown/AGENTS.md&lt;br/&gt;包职责 + 导出接口 + 本包特例&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; F[&quot;pnpm --filter @l-doc-hub/markdown test&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; A[&quot;合并前:nx affected,或&lt;br/&gt;pnpm --filter ...^@l-doc-hub/markdown test&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; M[&quot;PR 只含一个包的改动&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    T[\"任务:修复 markdown 渲染缺陷\"] --&gt; S[\"任务文本写明目标包\"]\n    S --&gt; W[\"读根 AGENTS.md&lt;br/&gt;全局布局 + 工具链 + 依赖禁区\"]\n    S --&gt; P[\"读 packages/markdown/AGENTS.md&lt;br/&gt;包职责 + 导出接口 + 本包特例\"]\n    W --&gt; F[\"pnpm --filter @l-doc-hub/markdown test\"]\n    P --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; A[\"合并前:nx affected,或&lt;br/&gt;pnpm --filter ...^@l-doc-hub/markdown test\"]\n    A --&gt; M[\"PR 只含一个包的改动\"]</pre><p>本仓库目前只有根级一份 AGENTS.md,细则放在 <code>.agents/rules/</code> 下按 core/sources 分域、由任务类型按需加载——这是嵌套思想的另一种实现:<strong>不靠目录就近,而靠索引 + 条件加载</strong>(分层上下文的完整设计与保鲜纪律见<a href=\"context-and-conventions-at-scale\">规模下的上下文与约定</a>)。何时值得拆出包级文件?当一个包的规则开始在根文件里反复出现,或与全局规则产生了需要显式豁免的例外时;在那之前,单文件加索引的维护成本更低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"圈定工作-但不要圈定验证\">圈定工作,但不要圈定验证</h2><p>圈定最常见的误用,是把「工作的范围」和「要验证的范围」混为一谈。前者应该小,后者必须沿依赖图放大。Nx 的 affected 命令把这逻辑做成了机制:Git 找出 PR 改动的文件 → 项目图谱定位这些文件所属的项目 → 沿反向依赖扩展成受影响集合,只对该集合执行任务;CI 中用 <code>--base=origin/main --head=$PR_BRANCH_NAME</code> 显式给出比较区间,官方建议基线取 main 上最后一次成功构建的提交(<a href=\"https://nx.dev/docs/features/ci-features/affected\">nx.dev/docs/features/ci-features/affected</a>)。</p>\n<p>不引入 Nx 时,pnpm 的依赖方选择器就是轻量替身:<code>pnpm --filter &quot;...^@l-doc-hub/markdown&quot; test</code> 会运行所有依赖 markdown 的包的测试。一条纪律足以概括:<strong>写集圈在一个包,验证集按 <code>...^包</code> 或 affected 展开,两者都写进任务文本</strong>——而不是指望 agent 自己想到去验证下游。受影响闭包的形式化定义与两类失效模式见<a href=\"../tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/affected-and-impact-analysis\">受影响范围分析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与实践清单\">反模式与实践清单</h2><p>反模式有三类。其一,给 agent 整仓默认视野,理由是「让它自己找相关文件」,结果是窗口被无关代码占满,检索反而更慢。其二,多个 agent 并行却圈在同一批包上,改动在 git 层面互相踩踏;并行度应等于互不相交的包子集数量。其三,只在对话里口头圈定、不落进任务文本——下一个接手的 agent(或同一 agent 的下一轮)立刻失去边界。</p>\n<p>可直接落地的清单:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>任务描述固定三段式:「主要在 <code>X</code> 工作 / 允许读 <code>Y</code> / 未经确认不改 <code>Z</code>」;</li>\n<li>验证命令写死在任务里:<code>pnpm --filter &quot;&lt;目标包&gt;&quot; test</code> + <code>pnpm --filter &quot;...^&lt;目标包&gt;&quot; test</code>;</li>\n<li>新包入库时同步建包级 AGENTS.md,哪怕只有五行:职责、导出面、已知坑;</li>\n<li>并行多 agent 前,按 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 的 glob 列表划分子集,确保两两不相交;</li>\n<li>所有过滤命令加 <code>--fail-if-no-match</code>,杜绝静默空跑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>圈定范围的本质是把 monorepo 问题还原成单包问题:用 workspace glob 定义边界,用 <code>--filter</code> 把边界写进命令,用嵌套或分域加载的 AGENTS.md 把包级知识放进包里。唯一不能跟着圈小的是验证范围——它必须沿依赖图放大。写集从窄,验集从宽,就是本节的操作纲领。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"把 Agent 的工作圈定到包","id":"把-agent-的工作圈定到包"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么圈进一个包有效","id":"为什么圈进一个包有效"},{"level":2,"text":"先定义包边界,再把范围写进命令","id":"先定义包边界-再把范围写进命令"},{"level":2,"text":"就近指令文件:嵌套 AGENTS.md","id":"就近指令文件-嵌套-agents-md"},{"level":2,"text":"圈定工作,但不要圈定验证","id":"圈定工作-但不要圈定验证"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与实践清单","id":"反模式与实践清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨包一致的工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/consistent-tooling-across-packages"},"next":{"title":"跨包改动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/cross-package-changes"}}